        "status": "investigating",
        "body": "Cloudflare is aware of, and investigating an issue with Durable Objects and downstream services which potentially impacts multiple customers in the Eastern North America region. Durable Objects are experiencing an elevated level of overload errors in the aforementioned region. This may also affect downstream services such as D1, Queues and Workflows etc. We are currently investigating this issue.",
